Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ce.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.34,0:00:35.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll see you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.40,0:00:39.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.54,0:01:03.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.32,0:01:37.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're as ready as you'll ever be.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.24,0:01:38.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go get them!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.22,0:01:42.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think that was meant to be encouraging.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.76,0:01:45.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He has an awful lot of confidence in us.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.94,0:01:51.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You may have fooled those silly\Nchildren with this brave act,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.82,0:01:53.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but we know that I don't win.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.30,0:01:56.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What makes you think it's just an act?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.90,0:02:00.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, it doesn't seem right\Njust leaving him there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.26,0:02:02.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fogs!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.18,0:02:04.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Remember, he wanted it this way.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:08.60,0:02:14.98,Sign,,0,0,330,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5\3c&H000000&}{\fs30\b1}{\fad(300,0)}The Wild Sea King! \N\NMetalSeadramon
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.90,0:02:18.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, the fog's finally clearing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.70,0:02:21.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Great, now he can clearly\Nsee that we're lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.90,0:02:25.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's more productive to think\Nof ourselves as on our way, Joe.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.20,0:02:27.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I feel better already.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.08,0:02:31.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All I know is I'm getting pretty\Nhungry, and I'm getting cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.02,0:02:33.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But everybody's okay, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.72,0:02:36.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides being hungry and cold and lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.00,0:02:40.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't forget frightened,\Ntired, and upset about Piximon.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.56,0:02:42.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Otherwise, we're fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.74,0:02:45.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have a feeling we've been here before.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.44,0:02:48.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute, look! What? Here, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.12,0:02:50.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those smashed-up foam boots!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.58,0:02:52.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.78,0:02:56.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, you don't think that they\Ncould be the same ones, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.94,0:02:57.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.85,0:02:59.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.26,0:03:01.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This whole time we thought we\Nwere making all this progress,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.82,0:03:05.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but now it looks like we've just\Nbeen traveling in one big circle.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.02,0:03:10.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How small they look from here, like ants.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.08,0:03:15.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Strange that such little creatures\Ncould cause so much trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.98,0:03:17.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They won't for long.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.08,0:03:20.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're standing on the\Nedge of my territory now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.50,0:03:22.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.46,0:03:26.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be the one to finish these\NDigidestined once and for all.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.34,0:03:28.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm, bold words.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.40,0:03:31.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you're not the first to make\Nsuch a boost, Metal Seadramon.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.26,0:03:33.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I will be the last.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.38,0:03:36.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There'll be shark bait\Nbefore the day is through.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.78,0:03:42.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So we've just gone around\Nin one big circle, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.04,0:03:45.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Makes the whole thing seem\Nkind of pointless, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.94,0:03:47.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on, maybe that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.52,0:03:49.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe the pointlessness\Nof it is the whole point.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.56,0:03:50.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Say what?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.47,0:03:52.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks for the philosophy,\Nthat's a big help.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.48,0:03:54.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Help, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.70,0:03:57.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, out there, someone's drowning.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.06,0:03:59.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Somebody's gotta do something.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.62,0:04:02.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're too tired,\Nthey'll drown themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.20,0:04:04.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, then in that case, we'll have to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.28,0:04:06.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kari. Whoa, wait up, TK.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.98,0:04:08.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe someone bigger should go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.78,0:04:10.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can use that outrigger.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.46,0:04:12.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm coming too, me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.26,0:04:13.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.17,0:04:14.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait up, I'm coming too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.28,0:04:15.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can help.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.66,0:04:26.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did his voice get lower or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.20,0:04:32.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hi!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.11,0:04:32.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A sea monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.03,0:04:34.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can say that again.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.34,0:04:37.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's Shellmon, and he's\Nnot here to play water polo.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.20,0:04:38.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That went crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.62,0:04:41.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no escaping you in my element now!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.34,0:04:42.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, guys, move it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.80,0:04:44.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stroke!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.71,0:04:45.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stroke!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.63,0:04:46.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stroke! Stroke!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.54,0:04:47.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stroke!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.45,0:04:48.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bro, right on top of us! Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.04,0:04:52.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.64,0:04:55.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ever hear of flossing? Bro, bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.44,0:04:58.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, are you guys battling or\Nam I just talking to myself?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.56,0:05:03.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.60,0:05:10.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We may be exhausted, but we can't\Njust sit here, we've got to help!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.80,0:05:11.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.96,0:05:13.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luna, Jurassic, you're saying\Nyou're a touchy strike!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.06,0:05:14.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.64,0:05:17.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.68,0:05:18.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.59,0:05:20.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon are the champions!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.32,0:05:22.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.44,0:05:24.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon are the champions!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.10,0:05:29.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Betamon, Digivolve to Aquilamon!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.28,0:05:32.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,synthesis,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.12,0:05:47.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.46,0:05:49.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Poison Ivy! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.70,0:05:50.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.88,0:05:52.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here's my Spiral Twister!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.04,0:05:56.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Super Shocker!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.12,0:05:58.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, Marching Fishes!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.76,0:06:01.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.70,0:06:02.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.61,0:06:03.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's more like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.53,0:06:04.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the way to travel.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.16,0:06:07.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm perfect at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.94,0:06:19.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know they're all dead tired and they\Nmay not feel like it at the moment,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.12,0:06:23.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I think today proved that our Digimon\Nare getting stronger and stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.60,0:06:25.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That'd be great, but\Nwhat makes you think so?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.02,0:06:28.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I remember the last time\Nwe took on Shellmon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.98,0:06:33.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Agumon had to digivolve into Greymon\Nbefore we could finally beat him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.26,0:06:35.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And even then it was close.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.84,0:06:54.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But this time they beat\Nhim easily without Koromon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.60,0:06:56.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but don't forget,\NTai, they ganged up on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.92,0:06:58.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was four of them against one.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.58,0:07:00.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But they didn't have to\Ndigivolve as far to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.74,0:07:03.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I still say it means you're\Nstronger than you were.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.10,0:07:05.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or maybe Shellmon's\Njust weaker than he was.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.86,0:07:08.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How come everyone's being\Nsuch a downer all of a sudden?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.48,0:07:10.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm trying to be positive here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.62,0:07:11.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.53,0:07:14.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I still can't get out of my mind something\Nthat Piximon said to me back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.98,0:07:16.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you said it was possible to save the
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.94,0:07:18.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,planet if the eight of\Nus were all together.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.92,0:07:20.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How come it's not happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.48,0:07:21.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's up, Piximon?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.54,0:07:24.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The truth is being together's not enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.94,0:07:27.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's something else that\Nyou need to do to beat them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.88,0:07:29.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think he meant we had to get stronger,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.84,0:07:32.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and that's just what's\Nhappening yeah maybe ty's
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.36,0:07:34.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,right i feel stronger\Ncome to think of it you
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.64,0:07:36.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,are looking kind of buff\Nthanks very much that's
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.82,0:07:39.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a compliment right do i\Nlook stronger to you izzy
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.16,0:07:43.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i don't know make a must\Ni was do i look different
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.52,0:07:46.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,tk yeah you look buffed\Nout to the max sorry
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.20,0:07:49.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,well to be honest you\Ndon't look any different
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.08,0:07:51.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to me but give it time\NGatomon you'll catch up
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.20,0:07:54.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,with the rest if you\Nsay so come to think of
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.22,0:07:57.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it your coat's looking\Nglossier really you think
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.60,0:08:02.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did it get brighter all of a sudden?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.92,0:08:05.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or is it just Ty's sunny disposition?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.98,0:08:09.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe it's like a mirage.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.70,0:08:15.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.98,0:08:17.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Was that shack there before?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.88,0:08:20.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe somebody moved in when we were gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.44,0:08:24.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mmm, something smells\Nsuspiciously like food.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.12,0:08:26.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's take it easy, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.70,0:08:30.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Remember, we're in the DigiWorld where\Nnot everything is what it appears to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.40,0:08:33.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks may be deceiving, but\Nsmells, that's something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.64,0:08:36.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I definitely smell\Ngrilling hamburgers. See?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.92,0:08:38.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a snack bar!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.44,0:08:40.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Burgers, sodas, ice cream, pizza!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.36,0:08:50.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mirage or not, I'll take\Nmy chances. Game away!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:47.38,0:08:50.34,Sign,,450,0,200,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord0\fs36\c&H171DA7&\b1}Ice{\b0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.24,0:09:03.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Mimi. Oh, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.94,0:09:05.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, what are you two waiting for?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.38,0:09:07.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, they're going to\Neat everything without us.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.44,0:09:08.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.74,0:09:13.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.26,0:09:15.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a trap!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.94,0:09:19.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Snack time!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:21.28,0:09:30.29,Sign,,0,0,110,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5\b1}Anomalocarimon{{\b0}
Dialogue: 1,0:09:21.28,0:09:30.29,Sign,,380,0,135,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Perfect
Dialogue: 1,0:09:21.28,0:09:30.29,Sign,,380,0,175,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Data
Dialogue: 1,0:09:21.28,0:09:30.29,Sign,,380,0,220,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Ancient Crustacean Digimon
Dialogue: 1,0:09:21.28,0:09:30.29,Sign,,380,0,310,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Special Attack
Dialogue: 1,0:09:21.28,0:09:30.29,Sign,,380,0,348,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Stinger Surprise
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.46,0:09:25.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Corbio Mon, one of\NMetal Seedermon's flunkies.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.30,0:09:29.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Between his pinches and his tail, it's\Nhard to know what the end of him is worth.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.92,0:09:32.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but the only munchies\Naround here are you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.06,0:09:34.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now say goodnight, it's bedtime.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.44,0:09:36.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.74,0:09:37.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.65,0:09:38.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Scorpion Storm!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.76,0:09:42.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't breathe!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.42,0:09:44.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.66,0:09:49.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those sounds never mean anything good.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.76,0:09:50.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.12,0:09:52.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.34,0:09:54.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something tells me this\Nmeans no chili dogs!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.68,0:10:06.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.32,0:10:08.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's happened to them?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.44,0:10:09.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aren't they...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.38,0:10:10.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,could they be?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.10,0:10:15.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well done, Scorpiomon.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.20,0:10:19.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These Digidestined are not so\Ndifficult to handle after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.80,0:10:20.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here's your reward.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.56,0:10:24.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, clams!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.38,0:10:25.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you, thank you, boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.98,0:10:27.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just love clams.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.06,0:10:31.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just can't get enough of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.40,0:10:35.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.90,0:10:36.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is it, boss?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.94,0:10:38.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want some? Quiet!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.64,0:10:40.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought I heard something.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.60,0:10:45.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't hear anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.02,0:10:49.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, now to finish them off.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.22,0:10:55.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Eight little gnats and\Ntheir Digimon accomplices.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.24,0:10:58.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.54,0:11:00.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's supposed to be eight of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.62,0:11:02.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Two of them are missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.18,0:11:04.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You chuckle-headed cockle shell.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.10,0:11:07.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop eating and find the other two now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.58,0:11:10.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got it right away. I'm on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.20,0:11:13.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come back here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.70,0:11:16.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hate it when they do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.66,0:11:19.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, slow down.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.98,0:11:21.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha ha ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.04,0:11:23.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got you now! Ha ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.48,0:11:45.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm allowed it! Ugh!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.52,0:11:48.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Too many clams for lunch!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.02,0:11:58.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no, not again! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.46,0:11:59.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.68,0:12:01.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not built for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.20,0:12:02.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This way! This way!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.04,0:12:06.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.46,0:12:09.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't run anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.44,0:12:11.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll just have to stand and fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.16,0:12:12.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.30,0:12:16.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.21,0:12:17.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We may not have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.86,0:12:19.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.20,0:12:21.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know, but he's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.82,0:12:24.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a lucky break.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.80,0:12:26.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lucky for us, he doesn't work out.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.78,0:12:29.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm getting my exercise right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.20,0:12:30.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My roots are exhausted.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.70,0:12:33.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I am so hungry, I could\Njust about eat seaweed.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.80,0:12:35.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait. Look it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.06,0:12:37.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.60,0:12:42.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.84,0:12:46.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get your mitts off my glass.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.12,0:12:48.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.30,0:13:22.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Scorpion storm! Oh yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.32,0:13:23.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How about some needle spray?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.80,0:13:26.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Harpoon torpedo!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.38,0:13:32.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If the Digimon really\Nare getting stronger,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.70,0:13:34.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they should be able to\Nhandle Scorpiomon no problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.98,0:13:38.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope so, but it doesn't really\Nlook like they're doing too well.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.74,0:13:44.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, put me down, you overgrown\Ncrawdaddy, before I get really angry!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.72,0:13:50.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't you come out from behind\Nyour shell and fight like clams?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.08,0:13:52.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mimi, cool it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.42,0:13:53.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think he thought\Nthat was very funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.02,0:13:55.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Scorpion Storm, run!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.84,0:14:00.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Squidward, we're the\Nones you want! Tail blade!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.78,0:14:06.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just love clams!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.12,0:14:08.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry up, now's your chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.30,0:14:11.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get moving, Digiball, Tokomon!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.92,0:14:15.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.83,0:14:16.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digital Masters!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.75,0:14:18.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon Highlight Champions!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.00,0:14:25.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tokomon! Digimon, Top!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.68,0:14:40.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lilimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.22,0:14:48.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not the way you build your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.42,0:14:55.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Surely you'll lose a chance,\Ncome from stability and kudos!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.28,0:15:04.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And how you build your missions,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.70,0:15:16.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, Pseudomon, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.64,0:15:21.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Monsterpaw, Tailmon!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.38,0:15:25.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tailmon, get it! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.26,0:15:28.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.17,0:15:29.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vulcan's hammer!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.92,0:15:31.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.24,0:15:34.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good night!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.32,0:15:43.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kari.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.14,0:15:46.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where is that fool with\Nthose other children?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.28,0:15:49.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm tired of waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.68,0:15:50.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Garurumon, faster!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.16,0:15:52.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We gotta move, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.46,0:15:56.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,did you really have to\Nbring along a souvenir that
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.72,0:15:59.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,does it I'll worry about\Nthe other two children later
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.74,0:16:09.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey guys, that time's
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.96,0:16:16.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,over you're gonna
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.36,0:16:21.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,be toast I mean literally what's going
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.00,0:16:30.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, hang on and keep\Nmoving, we're almost there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.80,0:16:33.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, hurry up, let's get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.14,0:16:39.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.08,0:16:41.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Farewell, Digi-Destin.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.60,0:16:43.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was a rare pleasure knowing you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.42,0:16:45.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Medium rare!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.42,0:16:46.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.84,0:16:50.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.75,0:16:51.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hot, hot, hot!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.14,0:16:52.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.26,0:16:54.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.17,0:16:56.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who's the hot-tempered foul-mouth who...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.08,0:16:57.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, it was you, boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.58,0:16:58.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, no problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.50,0:17:03.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.58,0:17:04.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.06,0:17:06.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All of them gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.26,0:17:09.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Scorpiomon!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.20,0:17:10.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How did this happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.30,0:17:13.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, well, you see, that's a fair question.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.94,0:17:15.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see, it happened...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.04,0:17:16.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Silence!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.95,0:17:19.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You failed me and I will\Nnot forgive. Failure!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.74,0:17:21.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I didn't think that you were!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.82,0:17:32.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.08,0:17:34.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Phew, that was a close one.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.10,0:17:36.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But we came out of it, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.42,0:17:37.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what counts.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.64,0:17:40.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hate to tell you this,\Neverything's not okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.66,0:17:41.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? Mimi's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.10,0:17:43.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you guys talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.60,0:17:44.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did I miss something?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.51,0:17:46.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Digimon still may\Nnot be strong enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.80,0:17:49.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Both of ours had to digivolve again\Nbefore they could beat Scorpiomon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.92,0:17:51.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And he was just a flunky. Frankly,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.16,0:17:54.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's hard to see how they\Nstand a chance against
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.10,0:17:56.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A fully Digivolved monster\Nlike MetalSeadramon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.14,0:17:58.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You could be right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.28,0:18:01.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe Piximon meant something else\Nwhen he said we were missing something.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.66,0:18:05.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever the secret is, we've got to find\Nit if we ever hope to save the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.84,0:18:07.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, and the sooner the better.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.56,0:18:12.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's MetalSeadramon again.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.46,0:18:16.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, I'll draw him up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.40,0:18:18.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Zudomon, you get the others out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.14,0:18:21.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yoo-hoo, you big ugly foe.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.26,0:18:24.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just my luck and fast, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.62,0:18:26.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, Pseudomon.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.98,0:18:27.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Move it, move it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.66,0:18:36.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you seen us?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.60,0:18:38.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know, and I\Ndon't want to find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.06,0:18:40.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pathetic, little fools.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.66,0:18:42.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think you can escape me by sea?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.70,0:18:45.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think it's safe to say he's seen us.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.46,0:18:49.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Master Seadramon, we need food!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.66,0:18:51.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, stop dog-paddling! Ha-ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.26,0:18:54.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tonight you sleep with the fishes!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.78,0:18:58.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Flower Cannon!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.56,0:19:03.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And as for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.80,0:19:05.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow! Lilimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.92,0:19:10.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Got you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.08,0:19:21.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-oh, is he gone? I don't\Nthink so. I can't stand
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.94,0:19:25.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this waiting i bet he's\Nright below us now get off
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.84,0:19:37.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, he's really... Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.92,0:19:49.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ultimate Stream!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.92,0:19:57.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're finished, you upstart Digidestined.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.76,0:19:59.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In a word, you're sunk!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.56,0:20:02.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.92,0:20:06.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.92,0:20:10.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Whamon!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.28,0:20:21.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, everybody!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.80,0:20:25.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never thought I'd want to be fish\Nfood, but we'll be safe in here!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.10,0:20:26.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Technically, it's a mammal!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.22,0:20:50.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You escaped this time, But\Nyou've escaped for the last time!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.76,0:20:55.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why did Whamon stick his spout in my\Nbusiness and save the Digidestined?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.00,0:21:24.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not afraid of my future. I'm not
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.44,0:21:28.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Afraid of my future.\NI'll give you a smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.02,0:21:36.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm in the middle of my\Nheart. I'm a weak person.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.40,0:21:41.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be able to get one more. I'm strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.64,0:22:12.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of my dream. It's a dream of a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.12,0:22:15.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,La La La
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.22,0:22:20.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,La La La La
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.28,0:22:41.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To be here, they fled to the Japanese sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.94,0:22:45.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But the dark gingers\Nwereunless to throw in the air.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.34,0:22:48.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The important cave is a secret to be\Npushed, into the deep sea of geese.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.02,0:22:51.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The enemy is still moving on, first\Nto make the national sea sea engine.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.96,0:22:54.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The opponent is the leader\Nof the Metal Seadramon.
